                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is the one time you should trust the metacritic score!\nThe only good thing about this visual novel is the opening and ending music. Everything else was lackluster.\nThe story went nowhere, the characters were all over the place and frankly it felt as if they were straight up queerbaiting. Genuinely WHY would you have two whole routes with men and then just not commit to it?\nEven the other routes of the female characters were just hollow!\nIt wouldn't even be that big of a problem if the story would have made up for it. Which it certainly did not.\n\nA big miss for me.",
